      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Let's be real for a second. Nailing the perfect pair of men's shorts is surprisingly difficult. Go too long, and they look baggy and outdated. Go too short, and you feel entirely out of your comfort zone. Add in the fact that most summer bottoms trap heat and restrict your movement, and itâ€™s no wonder so many guys struggle with warm-weather dressing.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
