      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "At Cottonworld, we decided to take the guesswork out of summer style. We believe your shorts should feel as relaxed as a Sunday morning but look sharp enough for an afternoon out. That is why our collection of men's shorts is crafted strictly from premium natural fabricsâ€”think 100% breathable cotton, incredibly light pure linen, and smart cotton-stretch blends. They keep the air flowing, pull moisture away from your skin, and give you that effortless, premium aesthetic without even trying.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
