      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "The Absolute Essentials: Navy Blue, Khaki, and Stone. You literally cannot go wrong with these. A pair of khaki or navy shorts will seamlessly match every single shirt or tee you currently own.",
