      "text": "Heading to the coast or a resort? You need linen. Pair our breezy linen shorts with a brightly colored or pastel [Men's Linen Shirt](https://cottonworld.net/collections/mens-linen-shirts). Roll the sleeves up, leave the shirt untucked, and wear it with some leather sandals.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
