      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Got a daytime date or a casual outdoor lunch? Take a pair of perfectly fitted navy chino shorts and pair them with a light-colored [Men's Polo](https://cottonworld.net/search?type=product&q=mens+polo). It shows you made an effort, but you still look entirely comfortable.",
