      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "1. Wash Cold: Always wash your shorts in cold water to completely avoid shrinkage and protect the rich, garment-dyed colors from fading.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00054",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[54]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 4886,
      "endIndex": 5013,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "2. Inside Out: Turn your shorts inside out before putting them in the machine to protect the fabric's surface and the buttons.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00055",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[55]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5013,
      "endIndex": 5142,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "3. Skip the Dryer: High heat destroys natural fibers and ruins the elastane stretch. Air dry your shorts on a line in the shade.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00056",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[56]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
