      "endIndex": 5338,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "4. Ironing: Iron cotton shorts while they are slightly damp. For your linen shorts, don't obsess over perfectly pressing themâ€”the natural, soft wrinkles are part of the premium linen aesthetic!",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
