      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00073",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[73]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5629,
      "endIndex": 5674,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "1. How long should men's shorts actually be?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00074",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[74]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5674,
      "endIndex": 5934,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "The modern, universally flattering length for men's shorts should sit right above the knee. Usually, a 7-inch to 9-inch inseam is the sweet spot. It shows just enough leg to keep you cool without looking overly short or turning into baggy three-quarter pants.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00075",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[75]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5934,
      "endIndex": 5935,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00076",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[76]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5935,
      "endIndex": 5982,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "2. Can I wear a button-down shirt with shorts?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00077",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[77]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5982,
      "endIndex": 6193,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Absolutely. A casual [Men's Shirt](https://cottonworld.net/collections/mens-shirts) with the sleeves rolled up paired with tailored chino shorts is an incredibly sharp summer look. Just make sure the shirt hem isn't too long so it doesn't swallow up the shorts.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00078",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[78]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6193,
      "endIndex": 6194,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00079",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[79]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6194,
      "endIndex": 6238,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "3. Which fabric is best for sweaty weather?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00080",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[80]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6238,
      "endIndex": 6419,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Pure linen and lightweight organic cotton are unbeatable. They promote heavy airflow, wick moisture away from the skin, and dry out incredibly fast compared to synthetic materials.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00081",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[81]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6419,
      "endIndex": 6420,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00082",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[82]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6420,
      "endIndex": 6465,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "4. Will my cotton shorts shrink in the wash?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00083",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[83]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6465,
      "endIndex": 6715,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Because we use premium natural fibers, you might notice very minimal tightening after the first wash, which relaxes as soon as you wear them for a few minutes. Just stick to cold water washing and avoid hot tumble dryers to maintain the perfect fit.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00084",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[84]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6715,
      "endIndex": 6716,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00085",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[85]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6716,
      "endIndex": 6771,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "5. Are drawstring shorts acceptable outside the house?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00086",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[86]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6771,
      "endIndex": 6989,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Yes! As long as they are made from high-quality fabrics (like our premium cotton) and fit well, drawstring shorts are perfect for casual outings, traveling, or grabbing coffee. Just pair them with a clean, fitted tee.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
